                <pb facs="0667" n="551" sameAs="frus:frus1923v01/pg551"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4835: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-01-26T13:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 26,
                                1923—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 26—9:37
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>32. Consul at Canton telegraphs Hu Han-min, sympathizer of Sun Yat-sen,
                    inaugurated civil governor yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
